<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 11.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Harriet Maru 170,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $5.25 fio scale/25,000 shinc 1-15/11 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>China Act 135,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Spanish Med. $16.15 scale/17,000 10-15/10 Hyundai Merchant Marine.</p>
<p>ORE - Hydroussa 140,000 tonnes ore Sladanha Bay/Beilun $6.25 50,000/20,000 end Oct Hanjin.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
